1
00:00:00,899 --> 00:00:02,199
(chuckles)

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
(Leonard:)Oh, hey, Penny, do you want
to go to the airport

3
00:00:04,403 --> 00:00:05,733
(Leonard:)with me later
to pick up my mother?

4
00:00:05,737 --> 00:00:06,767
(Penny:)Sure.
Thanks.

5
00:00:06,772 --> 00:00:08,202
(Penny:)No problem.
Hey, Penny,

6
00:00:08,206 --> 00:00:09,876
(Leonard:)um, since you're already
gonna be at the airport,

7
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:11,045
(Leonard:)do I need to go?

8
00:00:12,411 --> 00:00:14,911
(Sheldon:)Why don't you want to get
your mother from the airport?

9
00:00:14,913 --> 00:00:16,783
(Leonard:)Well, I can do without
the 40-minute car ride

10
00:00:16,782 --> 00:00:18,882
(Leonard:)where she criticizes
every aspect of my life.

11
00:00:18,884 --> 00:00:22,384
(Sheldon:)She can cover it
in a car ride?

12
00:00:22,387 --> 00:00:25,287
(Sheldon:)I could do 40 minutes
on your posture alone.

13
00:00:26,224 --> 00:00:27,494
(Penny:)You really want me to pick up

14
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:28,492
(Penny:)your mother all by myself?

15
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:30,223
(Leonard:)Hmm, I just feel like

16
00:00:30,228 --> 00:00:31,958
(Leonard:)it would be a good chance
for you to bond.

17
00:00:31,964 --> 00:00:33,564
(Penny:)Or a way for you to avoid her?

18
00:00:33,565 --> 00:00:35,865
(Leonard:)I don't know what
he's putting on those cards,

19
00:00:35,867 --> 00:00:38,167
(Leonard:)but you are smarter than ever.

20
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:41,340
(Penny:)Fine, if you really want me to,
I will pick your mom up.

21
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,440
(Leonard:)Seriously?

22
00:00:42,441 --> 00:00:44,041
(Penny:)Yeah, you know what,
she is my mother-in-law,

23
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:46,112
(Penny:)and I'd like for us
to have a good relationship.

24
00:00:46,111 --> 00:00:48,041
(Leonard:)That is very mature of you,

25
00:00:48,046 --> 00:00:50,876
(Leonard:)so I'm gonna go ahead
and say, “Suckah.”

26
00:00:50,882 --> 00:00:53,652
(Sheldon:)All right, back to learning.
Okay.

27
00:00:53,652 --> 00:00:55,252
(clears throat)

28
00:00:55,253 --> 00:00:57,323
(Sheldon:)Oh, easy, Bill Nye
the Science Guy.

29
00:00:57,322 --> 00:00:58,552
(Penny:)Or as I know him...

30
00:00:58,557 --> 00:01:01,227
“Creepy old dude
from Dancing with the Stars.”

31
00:01:01,226 --> 00:01:02,696
(Penny:)Ding, ding, ding,
ding, ding!

32
00:01:02,694 --> 00:01:06,334
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

